        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Bethel, Berks County, Pennsylvania; Interstate 78; U.S. states\n- Organizations: Assemblies of Yahweh\n- Companies: Dollar General; PetSmart\n- Topics: distribution centers; retail store presence\n\nFacts:\n- Bethel, Berks County, Pennsylvania, is home to the international headquarters of the Assemblies of Yahweh.\n- Bethel, Berks County, Pennsylvania, has several small-town business shops.\n- Bethel, Berks County, Pennsylvania, has a large distribution center for Dollar General and PetSmart that is visible from Interstate 78.\n- As of August 2017, Dollar General operated more than 13,000 stores.\n- As of August 2017, Dollar General operated in every U.S. state except Alaska, Hawaii, Idaho, Montana, Washington, and Wyoming.",
